@startuml
' ============================================================
' 二手交易系统 UML 包图：后端模块包与允许的依赖
' ============================================================
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 24
skinparam ranksep 34
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
  ArrowColor #5B7DB1
  FontSize 13
}
skinparam arrowColor #5B7DB1
scale 1.5

package "M1 账号与权限\napi / application / domain / infrastructure" as M1
package "M2 商品管理\napi / application / domain / infrastructure" as M2
package "M3 商品检索\napi / application / domain（只读）" as M3
package "M4 预约与交易\napi / application / domain / infrastructure" as M4
package "M5 信用与风控\napi / application / domain / infrastructure" as M5
package "M6 通知\napi / application / domain / infrastructure" as M6
package "M7 审计与统计\napi / application / domain / infrastructure" as M7
package "M0 公共层\nport / event / exception / web / util" as M0

M2 ..> M1 : 角色与封禁
M3 ..> M2 : 只读查询
M4 ..> M2 : 商品状态
M4 ..> M1 : 角色与封禁
M2 ..> M5 : 记违约
M4 ..> M5 : 记违约
M5 ..> M1 : 用户信息
M6 ..> M1 : 收件人
M2 ..> M6 : 通知
M4 ..> M6 : 通知
M5 ..> M6 : 通知
M7 ..> M0 : 实现 AuditPort

note right of M0
  依赖规则：
  0) M1~M7 编译期都依赖 M0（连线省略）；
  1) 只能依赖 M0 的端口与事件，不跨模块访问表；
  2) M2 不依赖 M4（下架级联走 ProductOfflineEvent）；
  3) M7 只被 M0 的 AuditPort 调用，不反向依赖业务模块。
end note

@enduml

